        "description": "Sold homes in Sweden on Hemnet with final price, asking price, price change and sale date, with the same location, housing form, price, rooms, area, fee and feature filters as the search plus `sold_within`. Each sale: id, slug, address, area, housing form, final and asking price, price change, sold date, rooms, living area, land area, fee, price per m², labels, coordinates, agency, link and `raw`. 50 per page; pass `next_page` back as `page`.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/hemnet-sold",
